samurai-code-freedom-name = Code of Freedom
samurai-code-freedom-desc = Freedom of body and spirit are vital for the health of the soul. To refuse it, or to take it from the honorable, is a great dishonor.

samurai-code-emotion-name = Code of Emotion
samurai-code-emotion-desc = Emotion is the fire that burns in the heart of the soul. The honorable let it burn and colour the world, the dishonorable become cold and heartless.

samurai-code-direct-name = Code of Directness
samurai-code-direct-desc = To speak bluntly is to show no fear. To dodge and weave with your words is to become a venomous spider, a great dishonor.

samurai-code-relaxation-name = Code of Relaxation
samurai-code-relaxation-desc = To let ambition and anger flourish is to abandon the honorable path of the calm and relaxed.

samurai-code-joy-name = Code of Joy
samurai-code-joy-desc = Joy and Happiness is the sign of a healthy spirit, to not be joyous is to have let the spirit wither and die, a great dishonor.

samurai-code-equality-name = Code of Equality
samurai-code-equality-desc = All are equal in worth and care, to refuse that equality, or rob it from others, is a great dishonor.

samurai-code-belief-name = Code of Belief
samurai-code-belief-desc = To stand by your beliefs is the ultimate sign of honor, to bend and break is to have none.

samurai-code-ceremony-name = Code of Ceremony
samurai-code-ceremony-desc = To take an action is to mark the physical world forever. To act recklessly or without care is to act with great dishonor.
